{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>See now that I, I am He.</b> That I was the one bringing punishment upon you." "<b>And there is no god with Me.</b> And this was not through the agency of the celestial princes and the heavenly host." "<b>I deal death and I give life.</b> As it says: וְהַעֲלֵיתִי אֶתְכֶם מִקִּבְרוֹתֵיכֶם (Ezekiel 37:12)." "<b>I wounded.</b> By the plague of Naḥ va-Nad (wandering), as it says: וְהִכָּה ה׳ אֶת יִשְׂרָאֵל כַּאֲשֶׁר יָנוּד הַקָּנֶה בַּמָּיִם (I Kings 14:15)." "<b>And I heal.</b> As it says (Isaiah 30:26): בְּיוֹם חֲבֹשׁ ה׳ אֶת שֶׁבֶר עַמּוֹ וּמַחַץ מַכָּתוֹ יִרְפָּא."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:25.234174490Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}